<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/assistive-technology> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Supports inclusive and accessible technology design in digital learning." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/assistive-technology/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/assistive-technology> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/fieldCollection> <https://id.i2idl.org/collections/field/human-centered-design> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/assistive-technology/versions/1> .
